104	7	xplanation in a Year 10 Essay \nExcellent (4): The essay uses several relevant and accurate pieces of evidence. Each piece \nof evidence is clearly explained and directly connected to the main argument. The student \nshows strong understanding of the topic. \nGood (3): The essay uses relevant evidence, but some examples need deeper explanation. \nMost evidence supports the argument, although connections may not always be fully \ndeveloped. \nDeveloping (2): The essay includes limited or general evidence. Some evidence is not clearly \nconnected to the argument, and explanations are basic or incomplete. \nBeginning (1):  The essay includes little or no relevant evidence. Ideas are mostly \nunsupported, and explanations are unclear or missing.	12	26	[-0.029197028,0.046876144,0.026242081,-0.043311466,0.0983406,0.022693386,-0.011974666,0.049146015,-0.019081533,0.008031139,0.05284373,-0.003728116,-0.036614288,0.022846382,-0.034108948,0.0199179,0.030980164,-0.047277804,-0.02144392,-0.01616061,-0.033890776,-0.067421414,0.02959839,0.02034231,-0.050291613,0.044310328,0.035837602,-0.033786982,-0.008828196,0.010153501,0.013271176,0.065907635,-0.01649655,-0.04969938,0.045883093,0.030890658,0.012806762,0.08253952,0.008083884,0.07854447,0.03594481,-0.050984405,0.019135294,-0.044617105,0.008959165,-0.036089472,0.043041952,-0.019139526,-0.09742626,0.019004777,-0.09475245,0.00086693274,-0.08914603,-0.07505472,-0.031239733,-0.05267387,-0.0029669085,0.021147281,-0.07592597,-0.08723221,0.08019347,0.00094239274,-0.092972666,0.055677373,0.05809945,0.015184124,-0.046183743,-0.03618211,-0.06500996,0.13130343,0.016814617,0.054240912,-0.040634114,0.04359068,-0.086840756,0.0042817853,0.025391541,0.000116555726,0.015485197,-0.089853086,-0.0045907423,0.08190051,-0.01933958,-0.057957955,-0.0070187156,-0.019470798,0.0025449952,-0.083388135,-0.15542209,0.073594466,0.1437048,-0.047768105,-0.031307988,0.040835265,0.11443928,0.05331098,-0.0062858155,-0.09088765,-0.0358249,0.016593866,-0.0207369